If I keep it, I'm asked every 20 turns (or so) what monster I'd like
to be turned into.
While in vampire form, I can increase the level of my human form.
BUT after I changed into 3 or 4 new vampires (because I kept the polymorph
ring to stay in vampire form), I return automatically to a human form, 
with a new name, AND ONE LEVEL LESS!

It seems you cannot stay in a polymorphed form for ever, more, if you try
doing so, you lose levels!!

Is that right? Any clues to use  rings of polymorph+polymorph control more
than a few turns?

